{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>SitPose 是一款溫和的坐姿教練，在你工作時默默留意你的背部。把手機放在身旁並開始工作階段，它就會透過前置鏡頭與裝置內建的姿態偵測，察覺你何時駝背或伸長脖子，再以提示音、語音或震動輕柔提醒你坐直；結束後你會看到一份簡潔的坐姿摘要。它適合長時間坐在電腦前工作或讀書的人，原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>私隱優先的裝置內姿態分析</h2>\n<p>SitPose 全程在裝置內分析姿態，以 Apple Vision 框架在記憶體逐格處理畫面，不會錄影、儲存或上傳影片，亦無需帳號或伺服器。提醒以你校準的個人基準為準，並設寬限時間及頸部與軀幹靈敏度，提示可選柔和音效、語音或靜音震動。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-279-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-280-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-281-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-80-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-283-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-284-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：SitPose – Posture Monitoring</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T11:59:37.802817+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":357,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}